>> show config
Slot    Device  Name            Type         Enabled  BaseAddr  IRQ     DMA
        7       ES1888          Embedded        Yes     220     5       1

So the perfect way of doing this would be to add following to kernel conf:
ess0	at	isa? port 0x220 irq 5 drq 1
opl*	at	ess?
audio*	at	ess?
Sadly ess only supports isapnp. I'm able to compile a kernel with ess* at
